error[E0277]: `u32` isn't a codec: it can't encode anything
 --> tests/ui/codec_not_a_codec.rs:6:21
  |
6 |     #[fiole(codec = u32)]
  |                     ^^^ not a codec
  |
  = help: the trait `Encode` is not implemented for `u32`
  = note: the codecs are types like `Str`, `OrderedU32` or `SerdeJson<T>` in `fiole::codec`, which say how an item is written
  = note: the `codec` of a field of a struct deriving `Fiole` must be one of them
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Encode`:
            &'a T
            (C1, C2)
            (C1, C2, C3)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7)
            (C1, C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, C7, C8)
          and $N others

